`charge under s 408` with `Carl Elias Moses, as an employee of the company` 's `text` is equal to You, Carl Elias Moses, are charged that you, on or about 23 October 1989, at the premises of Trans-Pacific Credit Pte Ltd, Singapore, being an employee, and in such capacity being entrusted by Trans-Pacific Credit Pte Ltd (“the company”) with property, namely, the proceeds of the sale of 2,000 Overseas Union Bank Warrant 1994 received by you from DBS Securities Pte Ltd pursuant to a sale (per contract number 414270/501) of the said warrants, for the purpose of paying the same to the company, did dishonestly misappropriate the said proceeds, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 408 of the Penal Code 1871.
`charge under s 408` with `Carl Elias Moses, as an employee of the company` 's `punishment` is equal to imprisonment for a term which may extend to 15 years, and shall also be liable to fine
not `offence under s 409` with `Carl Elias Moses, as an employee of the company`
not `offence under s 407` with `Carl Elias Moses, as an employee of the company`
`offence under s 409` with `Carl Elias Moses, as a director of the company`
`charge under s 409` with `Carl Elias Moses, as a director of the company` 's `made out`
`charge under s 409` with `Carl Elias Moses, as a director of the company` 's `text` is equal to You, Carl Elias Moses, are charged that you, on or about 23 October 1989, at the premises of Trans-Pacific Credit Pte Ltd, Singapore, being a director of a corporation, and in such capacity being entrusted by Trans-Pacific Credit Pte Ltd (“the company”) with property, namely, the proceeds of the sale of 2,000 Overseas Union Bank Warrant 1994 received by you from DBS Securities Pte Ltd pursuant to a sale (per contract number 414270/501) of the said warrants, for the purpose of paying the same to the company, did dishonestly misappropriate the said proceeds, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 409 of the Penal Code 1871.
`charge under s 409` with `Carl Elias Moses, as a director of the company` 's `punishment` is equal to imprisonment for a term which may extend to 20 years, and shall also be liable to fine
not `offence under s 408` with `Carl Elias Moses, as a director of the company`
not `offence under s 408` with `Carl Elias Moses, an employee but not entrusted as one`
not `charge under s 408` with `Carl Elias Moses, an employee but not entrusted as one` 's `made out`
`charge under s 408` with `Carl Elias Moses, an employee but not entrusted as one` 's `text` is equal to 
`charge under s 408` with `Carl Elias Moses, an employee but not entrusted as one` 's `refusal` is equal to A charge under section 408 would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of criminal breach of trust by an employee (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: being in any manner entrusted IN THAT CAPACITY with the property, or with any dominion over it — it is not enough that a person who happened to be an employee was entrusted.
`offence under s 406` with `Carl Elias Moses, an employee but not entrusted as one` 's `breach of trust`
`offence under s 407` with `the warehouse operator, Illustration (b)`
`charge under s 407` with `the warehouse operator, Illustration (b)` 's `made out`
`charge under s 407` with `the warehouse operator, Illustration (b)` 's `text` is equal to You, A, are charged that you, on or about a date unknown, at A's warehouse, Singapore, the property hereinafter mentioned having been entrusted to you for the purpose of storage for rent or charge, and being entrusted by one Z with property, namely, the furniture of the said Z under a contract that it shall be returned on payment of a stipulated sum for warehouse room, did dishonestly dispose of the said furniture in violation of a legal contract, express or implied, which you had made touching the discharge of the said trust, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 407 of the Penal Code 1871.
`charge under s 407` with `the warehouse operator, Illustration (b)` 's `punishment` is equal to imprisonment for a term which may extend to 15 years, and shall also be liable to fine
not `offence under s 408` with `the warehouse operator, Illustration (b)`
not `offence under s 409` with `the warehouse operator, Illustration (b)`
`offence under s 409` with `the Penang agent, in the way of his business`
`charge under s 409` with `the Penang agent, in the way of his business` 's `made out`
`charge under s 409` with `the Penang agent, in the way of his business` 's `text` is equal to You, A, are charged that you, on or about a date unknown, at A's place of business, Singapore, in the way of your business as an agent, and in such capacity being entrusted by one Z of Penang with property, namely, $5,000 remitted to you by the said Z with directions to you to invest the same in Government securities, pursuant to an express or implied contract between you and the said Z that all sums remitted by the said Z to you shall be invested by you according to his direction, did dishonestly use the said moneys in violation of a legal contract, express or implied, which you had made touching the discharge of the said trust, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 409 of the Penal Code 1871.
